cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "QAOA Satisfaction Fraction Verifier"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-05-01
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/johnazariah/qaoa-verifier"
authors:
  - family-names: Azariah
    given-names: John S
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-9870-1970"
    affiliation: "Centre for Quantum Software and Information, UTS"
abstract: >-
  Standalone verifier for QAOA satisfaction fractions on D-regular
  Max-k-XORSAT. Given pre-computed QAOA angles (γ, β) and problem
  parameters (k, D), computes the exact satisfaction fraction using
  the Basso/Villalonga branch tensor recurrence on the light-cone tree.
  Companion code for Shutty et al. (arXiv:2604.24633).
keywords:
  - QAOA
  - quantum computing
  - XORSAT
  - MaxCut
  - combinatorial optimization
